','Drilling of borewells, pump set installation, and electrification for small/marginal farmers from SC/ST and OBC communities.',1,'2026-11-23 11:17:46','2026-11-23 11:17:46'),(19,19,1,'Krishi Bhagya Rainwater Harvesting Farm Pond & Polyhouse Subsidy','Subsidy up to 80-90% for constructing farm ponds (Krishi Honda), polythene lining, diesel pump sets, and shade net polyhouses.',1,'2026-11-23 11:17:46','2026-11-23 11:17:46'),(20,20,1,'Micro-Irrigation (Drip & Sprinkler) 90% Subsidy Application','Up to 90% financial assistance for installing modern drip and sprinkler irrigation networks.',1,'2026-11-23 11:17:46','2026-11-23 11:17:46'),(21,21,1,'Krushi Aranya Protsaha Yojane Agro-Forestry Seedling Subsidy','Incentive grant of Rs. 100 per surviving tree seedling planted on farmlands and bunds over 3 years.',1,'2026-11-23 11:17:46','2026-11-23 11:17:46'),(22,22,1,'Yeshasvini Cooperative Health Card Enrolment Application','Cashless surgical and inpatient medical coverage up to Rs. 5,00,000 per family per year in network hospitals.',1,'2026-11-23 11:17:46','2026-11-23 11:17:46'),(23,23,1,'Raitha Siri Millet Farmers Direct Cash Incentive Application','Direct DBT incentive of Rs. 10,000 per hectare for farmers cultivating Siri Dhanya (nutri-cereals / millets).',1,'2026-11-23 11:17:46','2026-11-23 11:17:46'),(24,24,1,'Arivu Minority Education Loan Scheme Application','Low-interest educational loans up to Rs. 5,00,000 per year at 2% interest for minority students pursuing higher professional courses.',1,'2026-11-23 11:17:46','2026-11-23 11:17:46'),(25,25,1,'Vidyasiri Food & Accommodation Stipend Application','Monthly stipend of Rs. 1,500 for 10 months for backward classes students studying post-matric courses without departmental hostel accommodation.',1,'2026-11-23 11:17:46','2026-11-23 11:17:46'),(26,26,1,'Prabuddha Overseas Education Scholarship Application','Full financial sponsorship (up to Rs. 20 Lakhs/year) for SC/ST students accepted into top-ranked global universities